2    Formulas for the representations of SL(2, Z).

In this section we analyse a family of unitary representations of SL(2, Z) asso-
ciated with a complex finite dimensional simple Lie algebra g. First let us fix
some notation for g. (For details about standard material for Lie algebras we
refer to [22].) Let h be a Cartan subalgebra of g, and let h∗R be the R–vector
space spanned by the roots. We let X and Y be the weight lattice and the root
lattice respectively. Let h·, ·i be the standard
